From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: koyu <me@koyu.space>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:17:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/17] Use the BlossomOS Recovery look

The wallpaper landing page becomes Recovery's animated glow backdrop,
with a light variant that follows the colours the app actually uses, and
the step card becomes Recovery's window with its layered shadow. Headings
in Lora, the BlossomOS mark and name on the landing page, and the
BlossomUI Qt Quick style.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
